{"unit_id":"elviass__dsh-cost-insights#card-zh","repo":"elviass/dsh-cost-insights","commit":"1852682db97d6311a7ed96505dce6bb65bcf4cb4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Cost Insights（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：按会话、工作区、模型和日期汇总 DSH 的 Token 用量与费用。它监听 LLM 流并把用量、模型和会话信息记录到本地 SQLite 账本，同时在设置页、对话输入区和侧边栏展示分析结果。主要功能包括筛选用量、比较模型价格、查看可选 API 余额、同步汇率与价格，以及导出数据和备份账本。适合需要追踪模型调用开销的 DSH 用户。余额查询凭据可选，价格及汇率同步通过插件内置的公开来源完成。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:136-175","lib/client.js:609-611"]}
{"unit_id":"elviass__dsh-cost-insights#card-en","repo":"elviass/dsh-cost-insights","commit":"1852682db97d6311a7ed96505dce6bb65bcf4cb4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Cost Insights (DSH web plugin) records LLM token use and costs in a local SQLite ledger. Settings, composer, and sidebar views summarize usage by conversation, workspace, model, and date. It syncs prices and exchange rates, checks provider balances, and supports data export and ledger backup.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:136-175","lib/client.js:609-611"]}
