{"unit_id":"elviass__dsh-cost-insights#feature-1","repo":"elviass/dsh-cost-insights","commit":"1852682db97d6311a7ed96505dce6bb65bcf4cb4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Cost Insights 的功能「本地记录调用用量」：监听 LLM 流结束时取得 Token 用量，结合会话、工作区、Provider 和模型信息计算费用并写入账本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:136-175"]}
{"unit_id":"elviass__dsh-cost-insights#feature-2","repo":"elviass/dsh-cost-insights","commit":"1852682db97d6311a7ed96505dce6bb65bcf4cb4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Cost Insights 的功能「筛选用量分析」：在设置页按日期范围、会话、工作区、模型、Provider、用途等维度筛选，并查看汇总、分布和趋势。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:244-255"]}
{"unit_id":"elviass__dsh-cost-insights#feature-3","repo":"elviass/dsh-cost-insights","commit":"1852682db97d6311a7ed96505dce6bb65bcf4cb4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Cost Insights 的功能「查看模型价格与余额」：同步支持来源的模型价格和汇率，并可按配置查询 DeepSeek、OpenRouter、Moonshot、SiliconFlow 余额。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:260-277"]}
{"unit_id":"elviass__dsh-cost-insights#feature-4","repo":"elviass/dsh-cost-insights","commit":"1852682db97d6311a7ed96505dce6bb65bcf4cb4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Cost Insights 的功能「管理与导出账本」：从设置页保存预算和保留期、导出数据或 CSV、备份 SQLite 账本，也可清除历史记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:588-594"]}
{"unit_id":"elviass__dsh-cost-insights#feature-5","repo":"elviass/dsh-cost-insights","commit":"1852682db97d6311a7ed96505dce6bb65bcf4cb4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Cost Insights 的功能「在对话界面查看费用」：将当前对话统计扩展到输入区，并在侧边栏展示入口；界面跟随 DSH 语言变化。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:599-611"]}
